      "control_name": "AWS Service Principal Trust Must Have SourceArn or SourceAccount Condition",
      "control_description": "IAM roles trusted by AWS service principals (*.amazonaws.com) must include aws:SourceArn or aws:SourceAccount conditions. Without these conditions, the service can assume the role when acting on behalf of any resource in any account — including attacker-controlled resources. AWS Lambda execution roles without aws:SourceArn allow any Lambda function in any account to assume the role. SNS/S3 notification roles without SourceArn allow any bucket or topic in any account to trigger the role assumption.\n",
